        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        466.27439256535945,
        254.28328125000007,
        89.92428839869285,
        18.585281881313108
      ],
      "text": "Abstract",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZJLUUJ+CMR12",
        "size": 14.34619998931885
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.8773454656863,
        285.72920707070716,
        762.4668890114378,
        14.118482007575722
      ],
      "text": "We study excitations of the local field (locsitons) in nanoscale two-dimensional (2D) lattices of",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58808120915033,
        313.683713699495,
        780.7720977124184,
        14.118494949494902
      ],
      "text": "strongly interacting resonant atoms and various unusual effects associated with them. Locsitons",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58808120915033,
        341.7939245580809,
        780.6811205882352,
        14.118494949494789
      ],
      "text": "in low-dimensional systems and the resulting spatial strata and more complex patterns on a scale",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58808120915033,
        369.7484700126263,
        780.6458485294119,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "of just a few atoms were predicted by us earlier [A. E. Kaplan and S. N. Volkov, Phys. Rev. Lett.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58808120915033,
        398.56410606060615,
        31.407787050653596,
        12.72075473484847
      ],
      "text": "101",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ARYQIW+CMBX10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        151.94085825163398,
        397.85820202020204,
        749.3263002450981,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": ", 133902 (2008)]. These effects present a radical departure from the classical Lorentz-Lorenz",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        425.8127604166667,
        780.6806030637255,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "theory of the local field (LF), which assumes that the LF is virtually uniform on this scale. We",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        453.9224924242425,
        780.7543126225489,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "demonstrate that the strata and patterns in the 2D lattices may be described as an interference of",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        482.03222443181824,
        780.6813232434641,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "plane-wave locsitons, build an analytic model for such unbounded locsitons, and derive and analyze",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        509.9867698863636,
        780.3706578022875,
        14.118456123737417
      ],
      "text": "dispersion relations for the locsitons in an equilateral triangular lattice. We draw useful analogies",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        538.0970195707071,
        780.9028371323529,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "between one-dimensional and 2D locsitons, but also show that the 2D case enables locsitons with",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        566.0515779671719,
        780.8823873774511,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "the most diverse and unusual properties. Using the nearest-neighbor approximation, we find the",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        594.1613099747475,
        780.683768504902,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "locsiton frequency band for different mutual orientations of the lattice and the incident field. We",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        622.115855429293,
        780.8823873774511,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "demonstrate a formation of distinct vector locsiton patterns consisting of multiple vortices in the",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        650.2255874368686,
        780.499368995098,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "LF distribution and suggest a way to design finite 2D lattices that exhibit such patterns at certain",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        678.3353194444445,
        92.48758059640521,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "frequencies.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        228.9165996732026,
        678.3353194444445,
        672.3709918300653,
        14.11845612373736
      ],
      "text": "We illustrate the role of lattice defects in supporting localized locsitons and also",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        706.2898778409092,
        780.6808040441177,
        14.11846906565654
      ],
      "text": "demonstrate the existence of \u201cmagic shapes\u201d, for which the LF suppression at the exact atomic",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        734.3995839646465,
        178.50715494281047,
        14.118482007575778
      ],
      "text": "resonance is cancelled.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 10.90909957885742
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.58797904411766,
        773.9888371212121,
        252.2436451388889,
        12.89356818181821
      ],
      "text": "PACS numbers: 42.65.Pc, 85.50.-n",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ZZUVGW+CMR10",
        "size": 9.962639808654785
      }
    },
